Description: Let debian/control own distribution runtime dependencies
 The upstream Python project pins PyPI release versions. Ubuntu 26.04 supplies
 compatible cryptography and the PQ-VPN-specific pinned liboqs packages under
 distribution package names, so retaining the PyPI requirements would make
 dh_python3 emit an unsatisfiable cryptography version dependency.
Author: PQ-VPN research project <noreply@example.invalid>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-09-15
---
--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -11,4 +11 @@
-dependencies = [
-  "cryptography==50.0.1",
-  "liboqs-python==0.16.0",
-]
+dependencies = []
